{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    with middle of the this section i need "view all products" button, i need  small cart icon button and view all products button with link, i need cart icon for all plant images and view all products button with link
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:{{ block.settings.background }};padding:32px 18px;overflow:hidden}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font:32px Georgia,serif;color:#14231a;margin:0 0 18px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px 16px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{position:relative;flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:0;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;scroll-snap-align:start;box-shadow:0 3px 14px #142d1914}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{height:250px;background:#f1eee6;position:relative}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{height:100%;position:relative}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{height:100%;width:100%}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details{padding:14px 58px 18px 16px;min-height:130px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:20px Georgia,serif;margin:5px 0;color:#14231a}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;color:#5b6660;margin:0 0 10px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-weight:700;color:#1f5130}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{color:#5b6660;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:13px;margin-left:7px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:34px;height:34px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:8px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;padding:0 22px;border:1px solid #1f5130;border-radius:30px;color:#1f5130;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view:hover{background:#1f5130;color:#fff}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd60a;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:82%}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{height:230px}.ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{gap:14px}}
{% endstyle %}
<nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><h2 class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2><div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign product_key='product_' | append:i %}{% assign image_key='image_' | append:i %}{% assign title_key='title_' | append:i %}{% assign desc_key='description_' | append:i %}{% assign link_key='link_' | append:i %}{% assign price_key='price_' | append:i %}{% assign compare_key='compare_' | append:i %}{% assign product=block.settings[product_key] %}{% assign image=block.settings[image_key] %}{% assign title=block.settings[title_key] %}{% assign desc=block.settings[desc_key] %}{% assign link=block.settings[link_key] %}{% if product != blank %}{% assign title=product.title %}{% assign desc=product.description | strip_html | truncate: 70 %}{% assign link=product.url %}{% endif %}{% if product != blank or image != blank or title != blank %}<article class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">{% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_badge %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details"><div>★ {{ block.settings.rating | escape }} | {{ block.settings.reviews | escape }}</div><h3 class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{% if link != blank %}<a href="{{ link }}">{{ title | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ title | escape }}{% endif %}</h3>{% if desc != blank %}<p class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ desc | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if product != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ block.settings[price_key] | escape }}</span><span class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ block.settings[compare_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
{% if product != blank and product.available %}{% assign variant=product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}<form method="post" action="/cart/add"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/cart"><button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"/><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg></button></form>{% else %}<a class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" href="{{ link | default: block.settings.view_all_link }}" aria-label="View {{ title | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"/><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg></a>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer"><button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products">←</button><a class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_text | escape }}</a><button class="ai-nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products">→</button></div></div></nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const name='nursery-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(name))return;class NurseryCarousel extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]');this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});this.update()}move(d){const c=this.track.querySelector('article');if(c)this.track.scrollBy({left:d*(c.offsetWidth+18),behavior:'smooth'})}update(){this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft+this.track.clientWidth>=this.track.scrollWidth-2}}customElements.define(name,NurseryCarousel)})();</script>
